        <definition>void test_list_suite</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>test_list_suite</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Run all singly-linked list assertions.</para>
<para>Builds an append-order list <computeroutput>[alpha(1) -&gt; beta(2) -&gt; gamma(3)]</computeroutput>, verifies ft_lstsize() and forward traversal via <computeroutput>-&gt;next</computeroutput>, then exercises ft_lstdel() (freeing all nodes with del_dummy) and asserts the head pointer is NULL afterwards.</para>
<para>A second sub-test uses ft_lstadd() (prepend) to verify that two nodes inserted as <computeroutput>[first, second]</computeroutput> are stored as <computeroutput>[second -&gt; first]</computeroutput> in the list.</para>
<para><blockquote><para><bold>Precondition:</bold> <computeroutput>Libft/srcs/ft_stdlib/</computeroutput> must be compiled and linked. </para>
</blockquote></para>
        </detaileddescription>
